       01  PRINT-LINE12 REDEFINES PRINT-LINE1.
           05  DESC-LINE-1            PIC X(80).

       01  PRINT-LINE18A REDEFINES PRINT-LINE1.
           05  PRT-REMARKS-LIT        PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(72).

       01  PRINT-LINE19 REDEFINES PRINT-LINE1.
           05  REMARK-LINE-1          PIC X(80).

       01  PRINT-LINE20 REDEFINES PRINT-LINE1.
           05  REMARK-LINE-2          PIC X(80).

       01  PRINT-LINE23 REDEFINES PRINT-LINE1.
           05  DASH-LINE              PIC X(80).

       01  PRINT-LINE24 REDEFINES PRINT-LINE1.
           05  PRT-DATE-WANTED-LIT    PIC X(11).
