           05  FILLER                 PIC X(4).
           05  PRT-ONHAND             PIC Z(7)9.
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(4).
           05  PRT-AVG-ISS-LIT        PIC X(9).
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(2).
           05  PRT-AVG-ISS            PIC Z(7)9.

