           05  FILLER                 PIC X(3).
           05  PRT-ALT-UM1            PIC XX.
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(12).
           05  PRT-RESERVED-LIT       PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(2).
           05  PRT-RESV               PIC Z(7)9.
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(4).
           05  PRT-AVG-COST-LIT       PIC X(8).
           05  PRT-AVG-COST           PIC Z(10)9.99.

