           05  PRT-UM1-CONV           PIC ZZZZZ9.9(4).
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(4).
           05  PRT-ONORDER-LIT        PIC X(7).
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(3).
           05  PRT-ONORDER            PIC Z(7)9.
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(4).
           05  PRT-MKT-COST-LIT       PIC X(8).
           05  PRT-MKT-COST           PIC Z(10)9.99.

       01  PRINT-CODE-LINE4 REDEFINES PRINT-LINE1.
